NetAudit
Copyright (C) 2026 Andrey Semionov

NetAudit is an independent, modular network and server security auditing
tool. Its architecture — the plugin-based check registry, the SSH-based
audit collectors, the layered Logs Audit pipeline (Discovery → Collection
→ Parsing → Detection → Findings), the scoring and hardening model, and
the associated web interface — is designed and maintained by Andrey
Semionov.

